# CODEOWNERS — review requirements for Monitra.
#
# The desktop background runtime was rebuilt after a production-stability
# audit. The paths below own application lifecycle, threading, storage
# concurrency and durable synchronisation: a change here that looks harmless in
# isolation can reintroduce a hang, a zombie process, or silent data loss.
#
# Before approving a change under desktop/core, desktop/background_services or
# desktop/storage, check it against desktop/DO_NOT_DO.md.
#
# Replace the placeholder handles below with the real owning team.

# ── Default ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*                                       @manthanstoretransform-creator

# ── Critical runtime infrastructure ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Application lifecycle, service ownership, threading, structured logging.
/desktop/core/                          @manthanstoretransform-creator

# Background services: network, sync, timer, activity, notifications, recovery.
/desktop/background_services/           @manthanstoretransform-creator

# The single controlled SQLite access layer.
/desktop/storage/                       @manthanstoretransform-creator

# Entry point: startup and shutdown ordering.
/desktop/main.py                        @manthanstoretransform-creator

# The repository API over local storage.
/desktop/sync/local_cache.py            @manthanstoretransform-creator

# ── Guardrails ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Weakening these removes the protection, so they need the same review.
/desktop/tools/check_architecture.py    @manthanstoretransform-creator
/desktop/tests/soak/                    @manthanstoretransform-creator
/desktop/ARCHITECTURE.md                @manthanstoretransform-creator
/desktop/DO_NOT_DO.md                   @manthanstoretransform-creator
/.github/workflows/desktop-stability.yml @manthanstoretransform-creator
